uni-jibe-mahayuti-rift-in-public-after-mlc-poll-setback/articleshow/135317545.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/shinde-for-cm-pitch-shakuni-jibe-mahayuti-rift-in-public-after-mlc-poll-setback/articleshow/135317545.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T19:03:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135317672,imgsize-650132.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Double loss of double engine': Akhilesh mocks BJP over UP MLC poll results]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/double-loss-of-double-engine-akhilesh-mocks-bjp-over-up-mlc-poll-results/articleshow/135317352.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135317352.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Akhilesh Yadav criticized the BJP following their loss in the Uttar Pradesh Legislative Council elections held recently. He attributed the victory to teachers and young voters while alleging electoral manipulation by the BJP. The Samajwadi Party leader believes this defeat sets the foundation for the upcoming 2027 assembly elections. Yadav emphasized unity among marginalized communities and expressed gratitude towards supporters for their vigilance during the counting process.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/double-loss-of-double-engine-akhilesh-mocks-bjp-over-up-mlc-poll-results/articleshow/135317352.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/double-loss-of-double-engine-akhilesh-mocks-bjp-over-up-mlc-poll-results/articleshow/135317352.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T18:57:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135317465,imgsize-15