12821.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T18:14:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sachin Parashar</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135313164,imgsize-599425.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[It only takes one rumour: How a small trigger can lead to a deadly stampede]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/it-only-takes-one-rumour-how-a-small-trigger-can-lead-to-a-deadly-stampede/articleshow/135302224.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135302224.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[On October 17, a tragic stampede in Kolkata claimed 19 lives during the Durga Puja celebrations. The incident was caused by overcrowding, panic, and a misleading announcement about structural failure. Experts emphasize the importance of effective crowd management to prevent similar tragedies in the future. Investigators are examining various factors contributing to the disaster, including narrow exits and inadequate safety measures.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/it-only-takes-one-rumour-how-a-small-trigger-can-lead-to-a-deadly-stampede/articleshow/135302224.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/it-only-takes-one-rumour-how-a-small-trigger-can-lead-to-a-deadly-stampede/articleshow/135302224.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T16:30:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135302559,imgsize-192876.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['What is wrong with victims': CJI on digital arrest cases; calls for compensation from banks]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/act-as-protective-umbrella-sc-says-banks-must-compensate-digital-fraud-victims/articleshow/135301419.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135301419.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/act-as-protective-umbrella-sc-says-banks-must-compensate-digital-fraud-victims/articleshow/135301419.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/act-as-protective-umbrella-sc-says-banks-must-compensate-digital-fraud-victims/articleshow/135301419.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T15:53:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135301471,imgsize-191442.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SC disposes of Mahua Moitra's plea seeking public disclosure of AIF, FPI beneficiaries]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-disposes-of-mahua-moitras-plea-seeking-public-disclosure-of-aif-fpi-beneficiaries/articleshow/135297250.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135297250.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-disposes-of-mahua-moitras-plea-seeking-public-disclosure-of-aif-fpi-beneficiaries/articleshow/135297250.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-disposes-of-mahua-moitras-plea-seeking-public-disclosure-of-aif-fpi-beneficiaries/articleshow/135297250.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T15:47:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ayush Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135301282,imgsize-103854.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[From Hitler’s rise to farmers’ misery in India: How the Great Depression changed lives far beyond America]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/from-hitlers-rise-to-farmers-misery-in-india-how-the-great-depression-changed-lives-far-beyond-america/articleshow/135300062.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135300062.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The October 1929 stock market crash in the United States ignited a global economic disaster that resulted in widespread unemployment and business closures. In Germany and India, the crisis led to heightened political unrest and movements for independence. Falling agricultural prices devastated Indian farmers, pushing them closer to revolution against British oppression. Meanwhile, Britain faced significant industrial downturns and job losses, highlighting the urgent need for international economic collaboration.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/from-hitlers-rise-to-farmers-misery-in-india-how-the-great-depression-changed-lives-far-beyond-america/articleshow/135300062.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/from-hitlers-rise-to-farmers-misery-in-india-how-the-great-depression-changed-lives-far-beyond-america/articleshow/135300062.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T15:29:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135300476,imgsize-316570.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[MLC election results: BJP wins big, but Congress and Samajwadi Party send a message from Nagpur, Varanasi]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mlc-election-results-bjp-wins-big-but-congress-and-samajwadi-party-send-a-message-from-nagpur-varanasi/articleshow/135298231.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135298231.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[While the BJP-led NDA won big in the MLC elections across four states, it suffered setbacks in two politically significant constituencies: Nagpur and Varanasi where the Congress and SP held their ground.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mlc-election-results-bjp-wins-big-but-congress-and-samajwadi-party-send-a-message-from-nagpur-varanasi/articleshow/135298231.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mlc-election-results-bjp-wins-big-but-congress-and-samajwadi-party-send-a-message-from-nagpur-varanasi/articleshow/135298231.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T15:21:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Mukherjee</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135299191,imgsize-2052232.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Ballot paper, still we ask': Kharge dares BJP to dissolve Parliament after MLC poll setback]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ballot-paper-still-we-ask-kharge-dares-bjp-to-dissolve-parliament-after-mlc-poll-setback/articleshow/135298079.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135298079.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ballot-paper-still-we-ask-kharge-dares-bjp-to-dissolve-parliament-after-mlc-poll-setback/articleshow/135298079.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ballot-paper-still-we-ask-kharge-dares-bjp-to-dissolve-parliament-after-mlc-poll-setback/articleshow/135298079.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T14:20:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135298145,imgsize-1202334.cms"/>